    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "那时，所罗门将以色列的长老、各支派的首领，并以色列的族长招聚到耶路撒冷，要把耶和华的约柜从大卫城―就是锡安―运上来。",
      "en": "Then Solomon convened Israel’s elders—all the leaders of the Israelite tribes and families—in Jerusalem,[NOTE:1] so they could witness the transferal of the ark of the covenant of the Lord from the City of David[NOTE:2] (that is, Zion).[NOTE:3]",
